# 0. PROJECT NORTH STAR: SYSTEM SPECIFICATION

---

## 0.1 Brand & System Layer Architecture

```
                               ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
                               │             POTGROWHUB PLATFORM HUB               │
                               └─────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────┘
                                                         │
         ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────┐
         │                                               │                                               │
┌────────┴────────┐                             ┌────────┴────────┐                             ┌────────┴────────┐
│   GANJAGURU     │                             │   GANJAGROOT    │                             │ GHOST COMMERCE  │
│ (Intelligence)  │                             │ (Orchestrator)  │                             │ (Zero-Inventory)│
└────────┬────────┘                             └────────┬────────┘                             └────────┬────────┘
         │                                               │                                               │
┌────────┴────────┐                             ┌────────┴────────┐                             ┌────────┴────────┐
│  SPATIAL (XR)   │                             │  3DPOD / POD    │                             │ SOURCING/LOGIST │
│ (AR/VR Studio)  │                             │  (Production)   │                             │ (Fulfillment)   │
└─────────────────┘                             └─────────────────┘                             └─────────────────┘

```

* **PotGrowHub (Primary Ecosystem & Platform Brand):** The master parent entity, domain host (`potgrowhub.store`), progressive web application (PWA) container, and consumer-facing brand. It unifies digital content, product design, community interaction, and automated commerce under a single web ecosystem.
* **GanjaGuru (Intelligence & AI Assistant Layer):** The conversational LLM/RAG engine acting as an AI Budtender, Strain & Terpene Finder, and Automated Grow Advisor. It processes natural language inputs, analyzes user preferences, and generates personalized recommendations for products, strains, and cultivation setups.
* **GanjaGroot (Guardian, Orchestrator & System Persona Layer):** The autonomous backend agent swarm controller and safety framework. GanjaGroot handles background job orchestration, legal compliance filtering, supplier API routing, inventory telemetry checks, and automated system monitoring.
* **Ghost Commerce (Autonomous No-Inventory Engine):** A zero-cost, zero-inventory middleware that connects customer orders dynamically to print-on-demand networks, dropshipping suppliers, and affiliate fulfillers without local inventory holding.
* **Spatial Experience Layer (AR/VR/XR):** WebXR and `<model-viewer>` integration enabling 3D model customization, real-time color and texture rendering, and 1:1 scale augmented reality placement of glassware, accessories, and grow equipment in physical spaces.
* **3DPoD & PoD (Digital-to-Physical Production Layer):** The automated pipeline converting digital design configurations (STL, GLTF, SVG) into physical products via additive manufacturing (3D Print-on-Demand) and direct-to-garment/laser printing networks.
* **Sourcing Discovery Layer:** Automated web ingestion, supplier API connectors, and catalog synchronization engines that discover, index, and price-check items across partner networks.
* **Booking & Delivery Layer (Bike2Door Integration):** Hyper-local micro-mobility dispatch and appointment service layer managing courier routing, last-500-feet navigation, and consulting bookings for local equipment setups.

---

## 0.2 Platform Mission & Core Promise

* **Platform Mission:** To democratize cannabis hardware design, cultivation knowledge, and retail commerce through autonomous AI orchestration, zero-inventory production pipelines, and immersive spatial web technologies.
* **Product Promise:** "Instant personalization, zero waste." Every item ordered through PotGrowHub is engineered digitally, previewed in augmented reality, and manufactured on-demand directly by localized fulfillment partners.

---

