## 0.4 Market Boundaries & Compliance Guidelines

```
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                            JURISDICTIONAL COMPLIANCE                              |
+--------------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+
| ALLOWED NATIONALLY & GLOBALLY                    | STRICTLY REGULATED / RESTRICTED|
| • 3D Hardware (Pipes, Grinders, Accessories)    | • Direct Farm-Bill Hemp (US)   |
| • Print-on-Demand Apparel & Merch                | • State-Compliant Accessories  |
| • Digital Assets (GLTF, STL, Visualizer)         |                                |
| • Informational AI Strain Diagnostics            | RESTRICTED / BANNED            |
|                                                  | • Controlled Delta-9 THC Plant |
|                                                  |   Material (Handled via Local  |
|                                                  |   Dispensary Partners Only)    |
+--------------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+

```

* **Supported Jurisdictions:** United States (Federal Hemp & Hardware Compliance under 2018 Farm Bill), Canada, and select international jurisdictions allowing legal non-plant hardware and digital media.
* **Allowed Categories:**
* 3D-printed non-plant accessories (grinders, jars, custom stands, novelty bongs).
* Print-on-demand merchandise and street wear.
* Grow equipment, lighting, hydroponic setups, and seeds (where state-compliant).
* Digital CAD models, AR experiences, and AI advisory interactions.


* **Restricted/Excluded Categories:**
* Direct cross-border sales of schedule-controlled Delta-9 THC plant material.
* Unregistered medical claims (GanjaGuru strictly provides informational educational content, not medical diagnoses).



---

## 0.5 Capability Boundary Framework

```
[ User Input ] ---> ( GanjaGuru AI Engine )
                           │
         ┌─────────────────┼─────────────────┬─────────────────┐
         ▼                 ▼                 ▼                 ▼
   INFORMATION       RECOMMENDATION     TRANSACTION       FULFILLMENT
 (Free Access)     (Personalized)     (Requires Cart)   (Requires HITL)
  • Strain Data     • Product Pick     • Checkout Form   • Dispatch API
  • Grow Guides     • 3D Model Match   • Payment Proc    • POD Printing

```

* **Information Capabilities:** Unrestricted read-only lookup of strain databases, terpene science, hardware schematics, and general growing methods.
* **Recommendation Capabilities:** Context-aware suggestion of products, strains, and 3D printing templates tailored to user preferences and location constraints.
* **Transaction Capabilities:** Automated cart generation, price aggregation across suppliers, and order payload creation within the Ghost Commerce pipeline.
* **Fulfillment Capabilities:** Automated dispatch of print files (STL/3MF) to 3D POD vendors and apparel assets to dropship networks.

---

## 0.6 Autonomous Agent Governance & Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) Controls

* **Automated Execution (No Human Intervention):**
* Catalog price updating and affiliate link verification.
* 3D model rendering and WebXR file format conversion (GLTF/USDZ).
* GanjaGuru chat responses and strain search queries.


* **Mandatory Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) Approval Points:**
* **Financial Threshold:** Any single order transaction or vendor payout exceeding $250.00 USD.
* **Compliance Warning:** Any order originating from or shipping to a region with ambiguous hardware/hemp regulations.
* **3D Model Validation:** Initial STL file submission sanity-checking (ensuring water-tight mesh integrity and non-toxic material safety flags prior to physical print dispatch).



---

## 0.7 V1 Launch Success Criteria & KPIs

* **PWA Performance:** Lighthouse score $\ge 90$ across Performance, Accessibility, and PWA standards; core landing bundle loading in under 2.0s over 4G connections.
* **Zero-Inventory Operational Ratio:** 100% of physical orders processed without internal inventory storage.
* **Conversion & Spatial Interaction:** $\ge 25\%$ of users interacting with the 3D/AR model viewer per session; average session duration $\ge 3.5\text{ minutes}$.
* **System Latency:** GanjaGuru AI first-token response time $\le 1.2\text{ seconds}$; local 3D canvas render rate $\ge 60\text{ FPS}$ on mid-tier mobile hardware.

