2. Install Python and Set Up Your Environment
You need Python to run AI code. A virtual environment keeps things organized.
  • Install Python:
  ◦ Download Python 3.10+ from python.org. Choose the latest stable version (e.g., 3.11).
  ◦ Install, ensuring “Add Python to PATH” is checked.
  ◦ Verify: Open terminal (Command Prompt on Windows, Terminal on Mac/Linux) and run python --version. Should show 3.10+.
