3. AR product preview (basic)• Web AR via WebXR/Three.js to place a 3D mockup in the scene; simple texture/material variations.

4. PoD integration (1 provider)• Printables or simple 3D-printed parts with one fulfillment partner and live tracking.

5. Basic commerce flows• Checkout, order tracking, and simple email/SMS notifications

